#
#	OpenTPW swimming pools: a raised octagonal hot tub with one seat in the middle, one cell.
#	Every number marked "OpenTPW's own value" is a choice of this extension, not a value of the original game.
#
Info.Id			65500		placeholder: objects.json replaces it with the object's own id
Info.Name		"Spa Pool"
Info.IsChoosable	0		not offered as a choice to guests
Info.HasQueue		0		no queue and no entrance: guests do not walk to it, the pool code uses it
Info.WhichUIType	3		a feature (the build menu's Features tab)

# One cell. The unrotated shape's north (its top row, Blender +Y) has no special meaning: the spa works on any side.
Info.Shape
---
*
---

# No Info.Hoarding block: the engine does not read it (the construction fence is not drawn for these objects)

# OpenTPW's own keys: the engine reads them to know the object is a water attraction of this kind and which side of the unrotated shape must face the pool
Pools.Attraction	spa
Pools.WaterSide		*

Upgrades[0].CostOfUpgrade		800		OpenTPW's own value
Upgrades[0].CostOfResearch		0		An object without research cost starts researched
Research.Group		0
Info.PreviewAnimNum		0
